# AUTHORISED curriculum PDFs only (CONTENT_STORE=public). Key path = catalog key.
# A file belongs here only if it is registered in src/content/curriculum/hosted.js
# (written permission or Jazira's own work). Official MoE textbooks must NOT be
# placed here without written permission — see docs/CURRICULUM.md.
# Anything in public/ is also reachable at /resources/<key>, so never drop
# unregistered files here. The app serves registered files via /api/content/fetch.
